<title>TAIWAN: President sets 1997 profit target.</title>
<headline>President sets 1997 profit target.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwanese food giant President Enterprises Corp said on Tuesday its board has set a pre-tax profit target for 1997 at T$5.05 billion on turnover of T$27.7 billion.</p>
<p>In 1996, President reported a pre-tax profit of T$3.069 billion on turnover of T$27.241 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
